        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, tolot ekapolon ŋol elope neni a Paulo, kiŋit tema, “Tolimokinae ayoŋ, irae iyoŋ ituŋanan ŋini a Roma a?” Toboŋok Paulo tema, “Ee.”",
