        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu ekapolon tema, “Abu ayoŋ oruwor ituŋanan ŋini a Roma anakitac ŋisiliŋa ŋulu alalak.” Tema Paulo, “Nai arae ayoŋ ŋolo a Roma anauruunet.”",
