        {
          "text": "Nai acamit ekapolon a ŋisigarya aanyun kire ŋakiro ŋuna esitakinitotor Ŋiyudayan Paulo; aŋun, abu iŋes taparacu keŋ tolaca ŋiriko aneni a Paulo, tocunak ŋisacaradotin ŋulu apolok ka Atukot daadaŋ. Ya nai iŋes Paulo kitowuo alokiŋaren kec.",
